{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Tracks of the Arcana",
    "steam_appid": 2620870,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620870/extras/3c4b73212252b8bcb9414868a901c103.avif?t=1697814076\" width=600 height=70 /></span><br><br>Tracks of the Arcana is an adventure game which features classical elements from the genre with a tarot-inspired twist:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Solve puzzles with a magical inspiration<br></li><li>Jump from platform to platform<br></li><li>Take the role of a magical two tailed raccoon<br></li><li>Use your tarot abilities to create new items and alter their state<br></li><li>Defeat multiple enemies that stand in your way with specific mechanics<br></li><li>Ride a magical train that serves a travel sidekick as well as transportation</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620870/extras/f9894c1244cdc4bb621854a4faa62c9f.avif?t=1697814076\" width=600 height=70 /></span><br><br>Each time you play has a different feel with the Tarot Spread. Cards drawn change multiple aspects:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Each world is altered by the first card drawn<br></li><li>Your character is affected by afflictions and buffs with the second card drawn<br></li><li>Your tarot abilities are shaped by the third card drawn</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620870/extras/aea88ae6e9f79e5a2aaae454d1d5a7a8.avif?t=1697814076\" width=600 height=70 /></span><br><br>Gather magical resources throughout your adventures and craft new items:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Improve your train abilities<br></li><li>Solve puzzles<br></li><li>Access locked areas</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620870/extras/3c4b73212252b8bcb9414868a901c103.avif?t=1697814076\" width=600 height=70 /></span><br><br>Tracks of the Arcana is an adventure game which features classical elements from the genre with a tarot-inspired twist:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Solve puzzles with a magical inspiration<br></li><li>Jump from platform to platform<br></li><li>Take the role of a magical two tailed raccoon<br></li><li>Use your tarot abilities to create new items and alter their state<br></li><li>Defeat multiple enemies that stand in your way with specific mechanics<br></li><li>Ride a magical train that serves a travel sidekick as well as transportation</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620870/extras/f9894c1244cdc4bb621854a4faa62c9f.avif?t=1697814076\" width=600 height=70 /></span><br><br>Each time you play has a different feel with the Tarot Spread. Cards drawn change multiple aspects:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Each world is altered by the first card drawn<br></li><li>Your character is affected by afflictions and buffs with the second card drawn<br></li><li>Your tarot abilities are shaped by the third card drawn</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620870/extras/aea88ae6e9f79e5a2aaae454d1d5a7a8.avif?t=1697814076\" width=600 height=70 /></span><br><br>Gather magical resources throughout your adventures and craft new items:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Improve your train abilities<br></li><li>Solve puzzles<br></li><li>Access locked areas</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A tarot-inspired adventure game where you travel the cosmos with your magical train, fighting enemies and crafting resources, all while drawing tarot cards that shape your destiny.",
